    "text": "Here is a summary of the top news stories today from multiple major news sources:

1. Israeli General Election:
- Israelis are voting in a critical election seen as a referendum on Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu's leadership after three years of war. Voter turnout is the highest in decades with record early voting. Netanyahu’s future and the direction of the country are at stake in this highly watched election [NBC News](https://www.nbcnews.com/), [CNN](https://www.cnn.com/), [CBS News](https://www.cbsnews.com/), and [Google News](https://news.google.com/).

2. U.S. Midterm Elections:
- With just one week left before the 2026 U.S. midterm elections, key races are heating up as early voting surges. Democrats currently lead in several battleground Senate races. There is significant political tension, including legal challenges and claims of election fraud. Spending on the midterms has reached record levels, surpassing previous elections [NBC News](https://www.nbcnews.com/), [CNN](https://www.cnn.com/), and [ABC News](https://abcnews.com/).

3. Brazil Election Fallout:
- Luiz Inacio Lula da Silva defeated Flavio Bolsonaro in the recent Brazilian presidential election. Bolsonaro’s party has acknowledged the defeat, though Bolsonaro himself has not conceded. Former U.S. President Trump has called the Brazil election “rigged,” echoing claims of fraud ahead of the U.S. midterms [Google News](https://news.google.com/), [NBC News](https://www.nbcnews.com/).

4. U.K. Terror Plot Charges:
- Two men have been charged in the U.K. in connection with an alleged Iran-linked terror plot targeting the RAF Fairford air base, which is used by both British and U.S. forces [CBS News](https://www.cbsnews.com/).

5. Miscellaneous:
- The CDC warns of rising threats from drug-resistant germs causing thousands of deaths annually in the U.S.
- Celebrities news includes the death of Emmy-winning actress Susan Saint James.
- Legal and political battles continue around the U.S. Department of Justice actions and investigations involving prominent figures [NBC News](https://www.nbcnews.com/), [The Washington Post](https://www.washingtonpost.com/).

These stories highlight ongoing global political shifts, electoral battles in the U.S. and Israel, and security concerns internationally. For more in-depth reading, please refer to the cited news sources.",
